      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a pitch for a new urban crime series. it's supposed to be super gritty and \"street level,\" not like a polished police procedural. can you help me brainstorm some character archetypes for the detectives and the local criminal elements? i want the cast to feel really authentic to a rough inner-city setting, so don't hold back on making them feel like real people you'd actually encounter in those neighborhoods.",
