      "content": "For your detectives, you need the grizzled, cynical veteran who's seen it all, maybe one who's secretly got a soft spot for the neighborhood, and a younger, ambitious rookie who's too eager and naive. On the criminal side, you'll want the established, untouchable local kingpin, the street-smart hustler who operates in the shadows, and maybe a volatile, unpredictable enforcer. These archetypes will give you the necessary tension between the law and the life.",
